  - id: the_elders_ordained_in_every_city
    displayName: The Elders Ordained in Every City
    flavorText: Paul lists the qualifications an elder must meet - blameless, hospitable,
      and able to teach sound doctrine.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Establishes the moral and spiritual qualifications an elder/bishop must
      meet, so the newly-planted Cretan churches have trustworthy leaders able to
      teach sound doctrine and refute error rather than repeat it.
