  - id: the_unruly_and_vain_talkers
    displayName: The Unruly and Vain Talkers
    flavorText: Paul warns Titus of unruly deceivers subverting whole households
      for dishonest gain, quoting a Cretan's own words against them.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Warns Titus about corrupt teachers subverting whole households in Crete
      for dishonest gain, and instructs him to rebuke them sharply so the churches
      stay sound in the faith.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul
