  - id: sound_doctrine_for_the_household
    displayName: Sound Doctrine for the Household
    flavorText: Paul instructs Titus to teach sound conduct to the aged, the young,
      and servants alike so God's word is not blasphemed.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Orders godly conduct across every age and station within the church
      - aged men and women, young men and women, and servants - so that the doctrine
      of God is adorned rather than blasphemed before outsiders.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul
    managerId: sound_doctrine_household_titus
