  - id: the_grace_that_bringeth_salvation
    displayName: The Grace That Bringeth Salvation
    flavorText: The grace of God that brings salvation has appeared to all men, teaching
      them to live soberly, righteously, and godly.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Describes the grace of God that has appeared to all men, teaching the
      denial of ungodliness and worldly lusts and a sober, righteous, godly life,
      while looking for the blessed hope of Christ's appearing and recalling that
      he gave himself to redeem and purify a people for himself.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul
    managerId: grace_bringeth_salvation_titus
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 13450.000965323505
