  - id: washing_of_regeneration
    displayName: Washing of Regeneration
    flavorText: Paul recalls that believers are saved not by works of righteousness
      but by God's mercy through the washing of regeneration.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: States instructions to be subject to rulers and gentle toward all men;
      recalls what believers were before - foolish, disobedient, deceived - then
      describes salvation as coming not by works of righteousness but by God's mercy
      through the washing of regeneration and renewing of the Holy Ghost, so that
      being justified by grace they are made heirs of eternal life, closing with
      the instruction to maintain good works.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul
    managerId: washing_of_regeneration
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
