  - id: foolish_questions_and_the_heretic
    displayName: Foolish Questions and the Heretic
    flavorText: Paul instructs Titus to avoid foolish disputes and to reject a divisive
      heretic after a first and second warning.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Preserves unity in the young Cretan churches by warning against divisive,
      speculative controversies and prescribing a clear discipline process for a
      persistently false teacher.
